# Secrets — never commit. See docs/security/secrets-policy.md
*.pem
*.key
!**/testdata/*.key
secrets/
*.p8
*.keystore

# --- NSDK / Niantic credentials (GW-ARCH-001 section 13.1) ---
# Secrets live in the deployment secret manager, never the repo. NSDK writes an access
# token into its XR settings asset and an AuthBuildSettings asset on import; both are
# ordinary Unity assets and would otherwise be committed.
**/AuthBuildSettings.asset
**/AuthBuildSettings.asset.meta
**/NSDK Settings.asset
**/NSDK Settings.asset.meta
**/NianticSpatial*Settings.asset
**/*AccessToken*
**/*.token
tools/gw-signing/*.pem

# Unity Android/Gradle build intermediates (CMake, ninja, .o). 8 MB of machine-local
# absolute paths and NDK versions; regenerated on every build.
clients/gw-mobile/.utmp/
